{
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "rootDir": "src",
    "outDir": "dist",
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "src/*": ["./src/opencc-src/*"]
    },
    // zai patch (2026-08-30, plan P3 fix build errors — round 2): drop
    // composite to eliminate TS6307 cascade. With composite: true, every
    // transitively-referenced file must be in the project file list; src/
    // opencc-src being excluded made every `import '../opencc-src/...'`
    // resolve into an out-of-project file and trigger TS6307. The vendor
    // tree additionally references the `MACRO` global (stripped upstream,
    // substituted at bundle time by esbuild), producing TS2304 once
    // tsc started following imports into excluded vendor files.
    //
    // zai patch (2026-10-04, 修正上一段的错误论断):原文写「Without
    // composite, excluded-file imports are silently treated as `any`
    // ... tsc does not compile them」。**这是错的**,2026-10-04 实测证伪:
    // `exclude` 只裁剪 root file set(决定哪些文件算「根」),完全不影响
    // import 传递闭包 —— `tsc -p tsconfig.json --listFilesOnly` 列出
    // 3843 个文件,其中 2142 个是 src/opencc-src/**;在 vendor 文件里制造
    // 一个 TS2322,tsc 会如实报出来。所以 vendor 一直是被真实类型检查的,
    // 不是 any。
    //
    // exclude 真正带来的两个后果(都与类型检查无关):
    //   1. 不往 dist 发射 src/opencc-src/ 的 d.ts(dist 保持精简);
    //   2. **`tsc -b` 的 up-to-date 判定只看 root file set** —— 改 vendor
    //      不会让 tsbuildinfo 失效,build 模式直接报「up to date」跳过重检。
    //      这曾让 `typecheck` 脚本(第一步是 `tsc -b --noEmit`)对 vendor
    //      改动完全失明。类型闸门已改走 tsconfig.typecheck.json(非 build
    //      模式 + vendor 进 root file set),本项目保留 exclude 只为发射。
    //
    // `incremental` + `tsBuildInfoFile` retain incremental-build behavior
    // (the part of composite we actually wanted); `noEmitOnError: false` is
    // kept as a defensive guard for any future vendor import that slips
    // through and surfaces a benign error during emit.
    "incremental": true,
    "tsBuildInfoFile": "./tsconfig.tsbuildinfo",
    "noEmit": false,
    "declaration": true,
    "declarationMap": false,
    "noEmitOnError": false,
    // zai patch (2026-08-18): 只发类型,不发 .js。运行时唯一入口是
    // dist/opencc-core.mjs(bundle-opencc.ts esbuild 合成),tsc 编译出的
    // dist/compat/**/*.js / index.js / stateChangeBus.js 无人 import
    // (死重)。这里用 emitDeclarationOnly 只发射 bundle-entry.d.ts 类型
    // 链需要的 .d.ts,从源头消灭死 js(tsconfig.server.json 早已如此)。
    "emitDeclarationOnly": true,
    "sourceMap": true,
    "jsx": "preserve",
    "jsxImportSource": "react"
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.tsx"],
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules",
    "dist",
    "test",
    "**/*.test.ts",
    // zai patch (2026-08-09, 语义于 2026-10-04 更正):把 vendor 移出 root
    // file set,只为「不发射 vendor d.ts」+「tsc -b 不跟踪 vendor 改动」。
    // vendor 仍会被 import 传递闭包带进 program 并被真实类型检查,不是 any
    // (实测见上方注释)。真正的类型闸门是 tsconfig.typecheck.json。
    "src/opencc-src",
    // zai patch (2026-08-09): esbuild-only 聚合入口,横跨 vendor(opencc-src)
    // 与 compat 两个 tsconfig 项目,由 scripts/bundle-opencc.ts 编译,不进
    // tsc 主项目(否则 TS6307:引用被 exclude 的 opencc-src)。
    "src/bundle-entry.ts"
  ]
}
